{"after":{"art_sha256":"0ece61b53654a0192d72ee642342bfa6dd92e94526a406c0d54eb9545155ad2a","layout_head":"","world_sha256":"9e179490cafeebffc47bfc5af7aeb5e714c0a51931dc86e7e2cc38ce811ee74b"},"intent":"{\"base\":{\"art_sha256\":\"8ce1c27f32a1511c7719e0de5a8c7f9be4a22201ac3147da18521833ff7dd185\",\"exporter_sha256\":\"fbc3b3ba75be8d6bc2bbf7a1fe8486685a80b1417b79ca00d5e76e1436f40e9e\",\"world_sha256\":\"cca7d0978752d4e77b248a255130576fd32313e6310769be5b28d8c1b08b6488\"},\"brief\":\"plaza-night\",\"candidate\":\"C\",\"format\":\"VERDANDI-INTENT\",\"layout\":[],\"prompt\":\"make the plaza more imposing\",\"rationale\":\"Heavier cantilevers: both slabs lift to 7 m in a near-black concrete, and a third bridges the west edge at 7.6 m, so the sky over the platform is framed, not open.\",\"revision\":[\"+ material concrete_slab 58,58,62 0.90 0.0\",\"= canopy plaza concrete_slab 7.0 19,10 28,11\",\"= canopy plaza concrete_slab 7.0 19,20 28,21\",\"+ canopy plaza concrete_slab 7.6 19,12 20,19\"],\"scope\":[\"plaza/canopy/*\",\"material/concrete_slab\"],\"version\":\"0\"}","intent_sha256":"28ec5df3f4a01ef209e07471887704ed228c119703fe1d3fa78b819b015fe6c5","kind":"evaluate","observed":{"at":"2026-10-10T22:13:40Z","ms":{"apply":"1","base_export":"60","candidate_export_and_checks":"62","scope":"6","total":"128"}},"prev":"c7eacd625fbae4f7d9d5cc8f841bcb6a17a6772c4f4cd758ebcb9a7fb4e66aa1","protocol":"DIRECTOR-0","re_evaluation_of":"3","seq":"12","verdict":{"affected":[],"cells_changed":[],"checked_against":"1a6406b74a586c3433582919a5158f738e237f0ea4c2fb62c1c562efd3a39704","codes":["HEAD-MOVED"],"declared":["material/concrete_slab","plaza/canopy/*"],"failed_checks":[],"intent_sha256":"28ec5df3f4a01ef209e07471887704ed228c119703fe1d3fa78b819b015fe6c5","materials_changed":["concrete_slab"],"phantom":[],"protocol":"DIRECTOR-0","re_evaluated":true,"realized":["material/concrete_slab","plaza/canopy/19,10-28,11","plaza/canopy/19,12-20,19","plaza/canopy/19,20-28,21"],"unclaimed":[],"verdict":"CLEAN","version":"0","written_against":"88c5151740aa83b77991dba8f963c64774c00f89edb0f8dd0db5f5fc6af161ce"},"version":"0"}
{"accepted_leakage":false,"design_lines":[],"evaluation":"12","head_after":"c53d87349709b94c838953a565fd438faa46cd0f8aef0bdaf39a74bce0bd1f78","head_before":"1a6406b74a586c3433582919a5158f738e237f0ea4c2fb62c1c562efd3a39704","intent_sha256":"28ec5df3f4a01ef209e07471887704ed228c119703fe1d3fa78b819b015fe6c5","inverse":["- canopy plaza 19,12 20,19","= canopy plaza concrete 5.2 19,20 28,21","= canopy plaza concrete 5.2 19,10 28,11","- material concrete_slab"],"kind":"admit","observed":{"at":"2026-10-10T22:16:18Z","chooser":"the owner","note":"C third: add overhead framing after the first two changes have been re-evaluated against the current head (the owner, in the session, 2026-10-10); re-evaluated at #12, the composition judged from the stills before admission"},"parts_after":{"art_sha256":"0ece61b53654a0192d72ee642342bfa6dd92e94526a406c0d54eb9545155ad2a","exporter_sha256":"fbc3b3ba75be8d6bc2bbf7a1fe8486685a80b1417b79ca00d5e76e1436f40e9e","world_sha256":"9e179490cafeebffc47bfc5af7aeb5e714c0a51931dc86e7e2cc38ce811ee74b"},"prev":"57a4791a19ec5660dddb7a21895fa37966ab90f82baf073a339a4c704f3247be","protocol":"DIRECTOR-0","seq":"13","version":"0"}
{"art_text":"VERDANDI-ART 0\n# ART-GENERATION-0, the first brief: \"a rain-soaked brutalist coastal plaza at night\", dressed on the tactical\n# graybox. The art direction is the model's; nothing here moves a wall, a floor, a cover block or a spawn \u2014 those are\n# the admitted layout's and the graybox map's. Colours are R,G,B 0-255 (sRGB), lengths metres, light in lux or\n# candelas. The direction, in one breath: monumental raw concrete under a low sea fog, everything wet; warm sodium on\n# the lanes, cold moonlight from the sea to the south-west; the plaza ringed by stepped towers and a cantilevered\n# slab; team colours in the neon \u2014 amber at base A in the west, cyan at base B in the east, magenta where they meet.\n\nmap tactical\ntitle Rain-soaked brutalist coastal plaza at night\nseed tidewater\n\ntime night\nmoon 215 24 0.35 168,186,255\nfog 0.045 38,54,74 volumetric\nexposure 1.5\nbloom 0.9\nrain 0.8\n\n# every mesh names where it came from and under what licence\nasset cube /Engine/BasicShapes/Cube.Cube engine Unreal Engine EULA (engine content)\n\n# the palette: raw and wet concrete, black-water puddles, dark steel housings, three neons\nmaterial concrete       112,110,104 0.86 0.0\nmaterial concrete_dark   66,67,70   0.92 0.0\nmaterial concrete_wet    74,74,76   0.30 0.0\nmaterial floor_wet       46,47,50   0.16 0.0\nmaterial plaza_stone     92,90,86   0.22 0.0\nmaterial puddle          14,16,20   0.02 0.0\nmaterial housing         36,36,38   0.45 0.8\nmaterial neon_amber     255,150,40  0.40 0.0 emissive 255,150,40 40\nmaterial neon_cyan        0,225,255 0.40 0.0 emissive 0,225,255 40\nmaterial neon_magenta   255,40,190  0.40 0.0 emissive 255,40,190 45\n\n# the play geometry: what C holds, in the look's materials\nsurface ground floor_wet\nsurface floor  floor_wet\nsurface stair  floor_wet\nsurface raised plaza_stone\nsurface cover  concrete_wet\nsurface wall   concrete\n\n# regions: names for the places the look talks about (cells, x across and z down). The mid lane is two regions, west\n# and east of the plaza: one region crossing the plaza put two puddles in one place, which the exporter refuses.\nregion base-a      2,9  8,22\nregion base-b     39,9 45,22\nregion north-lane  5,3 42,6\nregion south-lane  5,25 42,28\nregion mid-west    9,14 18,17\nregion mid-east   29,14 38,17\nregion plaza      19,10 28,21\nregion north-flank 23,7 24,9\nregion south-flank 23,22 24,24\n\n# massing: the city beyond the walls, and the towers that make the plaza a room\nskyline concrete_dark 8 26\ntower plaza concrete_monument 16 30\ntower base-a concrete 6 10\ntower base-b concrete 6 10\n# a cantilevered slab over the plaza's north edge, and its twin over the south edge\ncanopy plaza concrete_slab 7.0 19,10 28,11\ncanopy plaza concrete_slab 7.0 19,20 28,21\n\n# light: the team colours at the bases, magenta in the plaza, sodium on the lanes, cold white in the flanks\nneon base-a neon_amber 2.9 3\nneon base-b neon_cyan 2.9 3\nneon plaza neon_magenta 3.1 2\nneon mid-west neon_magenta 2.6 5\nneon mid-east neon_magenta 2.6 5\nlamp north-lane 255,170,90 600 4\nlamp south-lane 255,170,90 600 4\nlamp north-flank 210,225,255 700 1\nlamp south-flank 210,225,255 450 2\nlamp plaza 225,235,255 500 3\n\n# water: black puddles that hold the neon\npuddle plaza puddle 35\npuddle mid-west puddle 25\npuddle mid-east puddle 25\npuddle north-lane puddle 20\npuddle south-lane puddle 20\n\n# viewpoints for critique: fixed first-person poses, each where a player can stand (yaw 0 north, 90 east)\nview base-a-exit    8,15  90  0\nview north-flank   23,8  180  4\nview plaza-centre  24,15  90  2\nview plaza-corner  20,21  40  6\nview south-lane    12,26  90  0\nview mid-west      13,16  90  0\nmaterial concrete_monument 84,84,88 0.88 0.0\nmaterial concrete_slab 58,58,62 0.90 0.0\ncanopy plaza concrete_slab 7.6 19,12 20,19\n","design_text":"VERDANDI-DESIGN 0\n# FPS-GRAYBOX-0 tactical layout, on the witness level (48 x 32). Three routes between two bases:\n# the north lane, the central plaza on the mid lane, the south lane; flanks join the plaza to the\n# side lanes. Cell = 2 m in the graybox runtime. The stairs at 7,26 and 34,28 are not written (the\n# language cannot), and the camera's cell 28,28 stays floor. Height, cover, spawns and targets are\n# not in this language: they are the overlay, tactical.gbx.\n#\n# clear the interior to rock, around the two stairs and the camera\nclose 1,1 46,25\nclose 1,26 6,26\nclose 8,26 46,26\nclose 1,27 46,27\nclose 1,28 27,28\nclose 29,28 33,28\nclose 35,28 46,28\nclose 1,29 46,30\n# the two bases\nopen 2,9 8,22\nopen 39,9 45,22\n# north lane and its connectors to the bases\nopen 5,3 42,6\nopen 5,7 7,8\nopen 40,7 42,8\n# mid lane and the central plaza\nopen 9,14 38,17\nopen 19,10 28,21\n# flanks between the plaza and the side lanes\nopen 23,7 24,9\nopen 23,22 24,24\n# south lane, written around the stairs, and its connectors\nopen 5,25 42,25\nopen 5,26 6,26\nopen 8,26 42,26\nopen 5,27 42,27\nopen 5,28 33,28\nopen 35,28 42,28\nopen 5,23 7,24\nopen 40,23 42,24\n# DIRECTOR-0 intent c6d1ba67fdc8: make the plaza more imposing (candidate B)\nclose 24,7 24,9\n","head_after":"cac46b5c8e284ba9f95f567814d7282d4bf11fe6af4b09186dc22bc7d86ddad5","head_before":"c53d87349709b94c838953a565fd438faa46cd0f8aef0bdaf39a74bce0bd1f78","kind":"rebase","observed":{"at":"2026-10-11T04:04:48Z","note":""},"parts_after":{"art_sha256":"0ece61b53654a0192d72ee642342bfa6dd92e94526a406c0d54eb9545155ad2a","exporter_sha256":"14e8fe848277b4be7fffc0d0f41adace48f4feb57662affcbc4dc6927e76e6c0","world_sha256":"9e179490cafeebffc47bfc5af7aeb5e714c0a51931dc86e7e2cc38ce811ee74b"},"prev":"2281e35c430f5b05bdc64eb8cf5ff2b0b572b822c8f0f0df6a423cd738df0e50","protocol":"DIRECTOR-0","seq":"14","version":"0"}
{"after":{"art_sha256":"24a4543d00bbaea33e96457d8586cc9432b31d6784f63f75f9482c03d1ab047b","layout_head":"","world_sha256":"9e179490cafeebffc47bfc5af7aeb5e714c0a51931dc86e7e2cc38ce811ee74b"},"intent":"{\"base\":{\"art_sha256\":\"0ece61b53654a0192d72ee642342bfa6dd92e94526a406c0d54eb9545155ad2a\",\"exporter_sha256\":\"14e8fe848277b4be7fffc0d0f41adace48f4feb57662affcbc4dc6927e76e6c0\",\"world_sha256\":\"9e179490cafeebffc47bfc5af7aeb5e714c0a51931dc86e7e2cc38ce811ee74b\"},\"brief\":\"plaza-night\",\"candidate\":\"A\",\"format\":\"VERDANDI-INTENT\",\"layout\":[],\"prompt\":\"make the towers read as one monumental mass, not a comb\",\"rationale\":\"The plaza's ring as a few large masses: each run of rock cells one block, cut into at most five segments stepped 2 m at a time from 30 m at the middle of each side to 16 m at the corners, each with a cornice thrown out 0.6 m high above every head. The bases keep their prisms.\",\"revision\":[\"= tower plaza concrete_monument 16 30 mass\"],\"scope\":[\"plaza/tower/*\"],\"version\":\"0\"}","intent_sha256":"4b139d886fa2222862667b8ed8278b6d7407291f1cffabaef1ed43548c6ce408","kind":"evaluate","observed":{"at":"2026-10-11T04:05:15Z","ms":{"apply":"0","base_export":"70","candidate_export_and_checks":"61","scope":"3","total":"134"}},"prev":"1341329c4e9aa12a68cb99be2a50b448e954f704e1461cb70eb1fd64cee38c4a","protocol":"DIRECTOR-0","re_evaluation_of":"","seq":"15","verdict":{"affected":[],"cells_changed":[],"checked_against":"cac46b5c8e284ba9f95f567814d7282d4bf11fe6af4b09186dc22bc7d86ddad5","codes":[],"declared":["plaza/tower/*"],"failed_checks":[],"intent_sha256":"4b139d886fa2222862667b8ed8278b6d7407291f1cffabaef1ed43548c6ce408","materials_changed":[],"phantom":[],"protocol":"DIRECTOR-0","re_evaluated":false,"realized":["plaza/tower/18,10","plaza/tower/18,10-18,13","plaza/tower/18,10-18,13:cap","plaza/tower/18,11","plaza/tower/18,12","plaza/tower/18,13","plaza/tower/18,18","plaza/tower/18,18-18,21","plaza/tower/18,18-18,21:cap","plaza/tower/18,19","plaza/tower/18,20","plaza/tower/18,21","plaza/tower/18,22","plaza/tower/18,22-19,22","plaza/tower/18,22-19,22:cap","plaza/tower/18,9","plaza/tower/18,9-19,9","plaza/tower/18,9-19,9:cap","plaza/tower/19,22","plaza/tower/19,9","plaza/tower/20,22","plaza/tower/20,22-22,22","plaza/tower/20,22-22,22:cap","plaza/tower/20,9","plaza/tower/20,9-22,9","plaza/tower/20,9-22,9:cap","plaza/tower/21,22","plaza/tower/21,9","plaza/tower/22,22","plaza/tower/22,9","plaza/tower/24,9","plaza/tower/24,9-26,9","plaza/tower/24,9-26,9:cap","plaza/tower/25,22","plaza/tower/25,22-26,22","plaza/tower/25,22-26,22:cap","plaza/tower/25,9","plaza/tower/26,22","plaza/tower/26,9","plaza/tower/27,22","plaza/tower/27,22-29,22","plaza/tower/27,22-29,22:cap","plaza/tower/27,9","plaza/tower/27,9-29,9","plaza/tower/27,9-29,9:cap","plaza/tower/28,22","plaza/tower/28,9","plaza/tower/29,10","plaza/tower/29,10-29,13","plaza/tower/29,10-29,13:cap","plaza/tower/29,11","plaza/tower/29,12","plaza/tower/29,13","plaza/tower/29,18","plaza/tower/29,18-29,21","plaza/tower/29,18-29,21:cap","plaza/tower/29,19","plaza/tower/29,20","plaza/tower/29,21","plaza/tower/29,22","plaza/tower/29,9"],"unclaimed":[],"verdict":"CLEAN","version":"0","written_against":"cac46b5c8e284ba9f95f567814d7282d4bf11fe6af4b09186dc22bc7d86ddad5"},"version":"0"}
