{"art_text":"VERDANDI-ART 0\n# ART-GENERATION-0, the first brief: \"a rain-soaked brutalist coastal plaza at night\", dressed on the tactical\n# graybox. The art direction is the model's; nothing here moves a wall, a floor, a cover block or a spawn \u2014 those are\n# the admitted layout's and the graybox map's. Colours are R,G,B 0-255 (sRGB), lengths metres, light in lux or\n# candelas. The direction, in one breath: monumental raw concrete under a low sea fog, everything wet; warm sodium on\n# the lanes, cold moonlight from the sea to the south-west; the plaza ringed by stepped towers and a cantilevered\n# slab; team colours in the neon \u2014 amber at base A in the west, cyan at base B in the east, magenta where they meet.\n\nmap tactical\ntitle Rain-soaked brutalist coastal plaza at night\nseed tidewater\n\ntime night\nmoon 215 24 0.35 168,186,255\nfog 0.045 38,54,74 volumetric\nexposure 1.5\nbloom 0.9\nrain 0.8\n\n# every mesh names where it came from and under what licence\nasset cube /Engine/BasicShapes/Cube.Cube engine Unreal Engine EULA (engine content)\n\n# the palette: raw and wet concrete, black-water puddles, dark steel housings, three neons\nmaterial concrete       112,110,104 0.86 0.0\nmaterial concrete_dark   66,67,70   0.92 0.0\nmaterial concrete_wet    74,74,76   0.30 0.0\nmaterial floor_wet       46,47,50   0.16 0.0\nmaterial plaza_stone     92,90,86   0.22 0.0\nmaterial puddle          14,16,20   0.02 0.0\nmaterial housing         36,36,38   0.45 0.8\nmaterial neon_amber     255,150,40  0.40 0.0 emissive 255,150,40 40\nmaterial neon_cyan        0,225,255 0.40 0.0 emissive 0,225,255 40\nmaterial neon_magenta   255,40,190  0.40 0.0 emissive 255,40,190 45\n\n# the play geometry: what C holds, in the look's materials\nsurface ground floor_wet\nsurface floor  floor_wet\nsurface stair  floor_wet\nsurface raised plaza_stone\nsurface cover  concrete_wet\nsurface wall   concrete\n\n# regions: names for the places the look talks about (cells, x across and z down). The mid lane is two regions, west\n# and east of the plaza: one region crossing the plaza put two puddles in one place, which the exporter refuses.\nregion base-a      2,9  8,22\nregion base-b     39,9 45,22\nregion north-lane  5,3 42,6\nregion south-lane  5,25 42,28\nregion mid-west    9,14 18,17\nregion mid-east   29,14 38,17\nregion plaza      19,10 28,21\nregion north-flank 23,7 24,9\nregion south-flank 23,22 24,24\n\n# massing: the city beyond the walls, and the towers that make the plaza a room\nskyline concrete_dark 8 26\ntower plaza concrete_monument 16 30\ntower base-a concrete 6 10\ntower base-b concrete 6 10\n# a cantilevered slab over the plaza's north edge, and its twin over the south edge\ncanopy plaza concrete_slab 7.0 19,10 28,11\ncanopy plaza concrete_slab 7.0 19,20 28,21\n\n# light: the team colours at the bases, magenta in the plaza, sodium on the lanes, cold white in the flanks\nneon base-a neon_amber 2.9 3\nneon base-b neon_cyan 2.9 3\nneon plaza neon_magenta 3.1 2\nneon mid-west neon_magenta 2.6 5\nneon mid-east neon_magenta 2.6 5\nlamp north-lane 255,170,90 600 4\nlamp south-lane 255,170,90 600 4\nlamp north-flank 210,225,255 700 1\nlamp south-flank 210,225,255 450 2\nlamp plaza 225,235,255 500 3\n\n# water: black puddles that hold the neon\npuddle plaza puddle 35\npuddle mid-west puddle 25\npuddle mid-east puddle 25\npuddle north-lane puddle 20\npuddle south-lane puddle 20\n\n# viewpoints for critique: fixed first-person poses, each where a player can stand (yaw 0 north, 90 east)\nview base-a-exit    8,15  90  0\nview north-flank   23,8  180  4\nview plaza-centre  24,15  90  2\nview plaza-corner  20,21  40  6\nview south-lane    12,26  90  0\nview mid-west      13,16  90  0\nmaterial concrete_monument 84,84,88 0.88 0.0\nmaterial concrete_slab 58,58,62 0.90 0.0\ncanopy plaza concrete_slab 7.6 19,12 20,19\n","design_text":"VERDANDI-DESIGN 0\n# FPS-GRAYBOX-0 tactical layout, on the witness level (48 x 32). Three routes between two bases:\n# the north lane, the central plaza on the mid lane, the south lane; flanks join the plaza to the\n# side lanes. Cell = 2 m in the graybox runtime. The stairs at 7,26 and 34,28 are not written (the\n# language cannot), and the camera's cell 28,28 stays floor. Height, cover, spawns and targets are\n# not in this language: they are the overlay, tactical.gbx.\n#\n# clear the interior to rock, around the two stairs and the camera\nclose 1,1 46,25\nclose 1,26 6,26\nclose 8,26 46,26\nclose 1,27 46,27\nclose 1,28 27,28\nclose 29,28 33,28\nclose 35,28 46,28\nclose 1,29 46,30\n# the two bases\nopen 2,9 8,22\nopen 39,9 45,22\n# north lane and its connectors to the bases\nopen 5,3 42,6\nopen 5,7 7,8\nopen 40,7 42,8\n# mid lane and the central plaza\nopen 9,14 38,17\nopen 19,10 28,21\n# flanks between the plaza and the side lanes\nopen 23,7 24,9\nopen 23,22 24,24\n# south lane, written around the stairs, and its connectors\nopen 5,25 42,25\nopen 5,26 6,26\nopen 8,26 42,26\nopen 5,27 42,27\nopen 5,28 33,28\nopen 35,28 42,28\nopen 5,23 7,24\nopen 40,23 42,24\n# DIRECTOR-0 intent c6d1ba67fdc8: make the plaza more imposing (candidate B)\nclose 24,7 24,9\n","head_after":"1ff8e5e8f6be1450e48ed2f988dd647ede0e6720bb60a59df5e44b034b775dad","head_before":"cac46b5c8e284ba9f95f567814d7282d4bf11fe6af4b09186dc22bc7d86ddad5","kind":"rebase","observed":{"at":"2026-10-11T07:03:17Z","note":"art/dress.py: the canopy's 'edgelit R,G,B CANDELAS' option, a narrow row of small fixtures along the edge that faces the region's middle, one a metre, each with its light, for the owner's art note of 2026-10-11 on the cantilevers; art/check.py's plants for the canopy's options now show the slab alone passing. The brief uses no new option, so its scene's bytes are unchanged."},"parts_after":{"art_sha256":"0ece61b53654a0192d72ee642342bfa6dd92e94526a406c0d54eb9545155ad2a","exporter_sha256":"a59ea668fa5f46111044ac00e4702c8037560a2fb4f97ac57761ee5abcc05261","world_sha256":"9e179490cafeebffc47bfc5af7aeb5e714c0a51931dc86e7e2cc38ce811ee74b"},"prev":"5fad630b6fb048c4662cb4ff79fa07568a43ddb51df33ab48507ff8ec546d129","protocol":"DIRECTOR-0","seq":"21","version":"0"}
{"after":{"art_sha256":"2a4d9642adb25014c4c7e4b048a93ca4f647f2c9f54c68ceac330dc8f8c244d6","layout_head":"","world_sha256":"9e179490cafeebffc47bfc5af7aeb5e714c0a51931dc86e7e2cc38ce811ee74b"},"intent":"{\"base\":{\"art_sha256\":\"0ece61b53654a0192d72ee642342bfa6dd92e94526a406c0d54eb9545155ad2a\",\"exporter_sha256\":\"a59ea668fa5f46111044ac00e4702c8037560a2fb4f97ac57761ee5abcc05261\",\"world_sha256\":\"9e179490cafeebffc47bfc5af7aeb5e714c0a51931dc86e7e2cc38ce811ee74b\"},\"brief\":\"plaza-night\",\"candidate\":\"D\",\"format\":\"VERDANDI-INTENT\",\"layout\":[],\"prompt\":\"make the cantilevers more imposing\",\"rationale\":\"The owner's note on the round's sheet: 'Make the nearest cantilever lower and larger in frame, then keep its underside mostly dark with a narrow row of warm fixtures along the edge.' The north slab alone, brought down from 7.0 to 4.6 m and made 2.2 m deep, over the same two rows of cells (a third row would put the plaza's pole lamps under it, lighting the underside); dark beneath but for a row of small warm fixtures, one a metre, along the edge that faces the plaza. The other slabs, the lamps and the neon as they are.\",\"revision\":[\"= canopy plaza concrete_slab 4.6 19,10 28,11 deep 2.2 edgelit 255,178,112 120\"],\"scope\":[\"plaza/canopy/*\"],\"version\":\"0\"}","intent_sha256":"7d5b939d3a4c5b6108832aadcdff7ead9f64a6a0b1fbfc06fdb47d9a7598e29d","kind":"evaluate","observed":{"at":"2026-10-11T07:03:17Z","ms":{"apply":"0","base_export":"42","candidate_export_and_checks":"41","scope":"4","total":"87"}},"prev":"d40964dd4f4260dd60db69fdd71e8907ef2e1ca74568335ef8729c9ddf1181a2","protocol":"DIRECTOR-0","re_evaluation_of":"","seq":"22","verdict":{"affected":[],"cells_changed":[],"checked_against":"1ff8e5e8f6be1450e48ed2f988dd647ede0e6720bb60a59df5e44b034b775dad","codes":[],"declared":["plaza/canopy/*"],"failed_checks":[],"intent_sha256":"7d5b939d3a4c5b6108832aadcdff7ead9f64a6a0b1fbfc06fdb47d9a7598e29d","materials_changed":[],"phantom":[],"protocol":"DIRECTOR-0","re_evaluated":false,"realized":["plaza/canopy/19,10-28,11","plaza/canopy/19,10-28,11:light-edge0","plaza/canopy/19,10-28,11:light-edge1","plaza/canopy/19,10-28,11:light-edge10","plaza/canopy/19,10-28,11:light-edge11","plaza/canopy/19,10-28,11:light-edge12","plaza/canopy/19,10-28,11:light-edge13","plaza/canopy/19,10-28,11:light-edge14","plaza/canopy/19,10-28,11:light-edge15","plaza/canopy/19,10-28,11:light-edge16","plaza/canopy/19,10-28,11:light-edge17","plaza/canopy/19,10-28,11:light-edge18","plaza/canopy/19,10-28,11:light-edge19","plaza/canopy/19,10-28,11:light-edge2","plaza/canopy/19,10-28,11:light-edge3","plaza/canopy/19,10-28,11:light-edge4","plaza/canopy/19,10-28,11:light-edge5","plaza/canopy/19,10-28,11:light-edge6","plaza/canopy/19,10-28,11:light-edge7","plaza/canopy/19,10-28,11:light-edge8","plaza/canopy/19,10-28,11:light-edge9"],"unclaimed":[],"verdict":"CLEAN","version":"0","written_against":"1ff8e5e8f6be1450e48ed2f988dd647ede0e6720bb60a59df5e44b034b775dad"},"version":"0"}
{"after":{"art_sha256":"35ed21ed65ee322479e8980c5971ca3ded12aea416c7811a6b81cdce5aa3d658","layout_head":"","world_sha256":"9e179490cafeebffc47bfc5af7aeb5e714c0a51931dc86e7e2cc38ce811ee74b"},"intent":"{\"base\":{\"art_sha256\":\"0ece61b53654a0192d72ee642342bfa6dd92e94526a406c0d54eb9545155ad2a\",\"exporter_sha256\":\"a59ea668fa5f46111044ac00e4702c8037560a2fb4f97ac57761ee5abcc05261\",\"world_sha256\":\"9e179490cafeebffc47bfc5af7aeb5e714c0a51931dc86e7e2cc38ce811ee74b\"},\"brief\":\"plaza-night\",\"candidate\":\"E\",\"format\":\"VERDANDI-INTENT\",\"layout\":[],\"prompt\":\"make the cantilevers more imposing\",\"rationale\":\"D's north slab, with the far slabs as in C (deep, ribbed, downlit), so that the low dark slab reads against lit ones behind it.\",\"revision\":[\"= canopy plaza concrete_slab 4.6 19,10 28,11 deep 2.2 edgelit 255,178,112 120\",\"= canopy plaza concrete_slab 7.0 19,20 28,21 deep 1.2 ribs 2 lit 255,196,140 260\",\"= canopy plaza concrete_slab 7.6 19,12 20,19 deep 1.2 ribs 2 lit 255,196,140 260\"],\"scope\":[\"plaza/canopy/*\"],\"version\":\"0\"}","intent_sha256":"d23b67f25e7a9244af1eb7e9576a75053cdef8c305a3589669e764f7ea357ff9","kind":"evaluate","observed":{"at":"2026-10-11T07:03:17Z","ms":{"apply":"0","base_export":"40","candidate_export_and_checks":"40","scope":"4","total":"85"}},"prev":"131a0c9a398a68c5d80466c7f901978ce41015b19a6d96181be36a8cc0222c54","protocol":"DIRECTOR-0","re_evaluation_of":"","seq":"23","verdict":{"affected":[],"cells_changed":[],"checked_against":"1ff8e5e8f6be1450e48ed2f988dd647ede0e6720bb60a59df5e44b034b775dad","codes":[],"declared":["plaza/canopy/*"],"failed_checks":[],"intent_sha256":"d23b67f25e7a9244af1eb7e9576a75053cdef8c305a3589669e764f7ea357ff9","materials_changed":[],"phantom":[],"protocol":"DIRECTOR-0","re_evaluated":false,"realized":["plaza/canopy/19,10-28,11","plaza/canopy/19,10-28,11:light-edge0","plaza/canopy/19,10-28,11:light-edge1","plaza/canopy/19,10-28,11:light-edge10","plaza/canopy/19,10-28,11:light-edge11","pl